  << /ActualText (ARTISAN is a modern podiatry and foot care clinic focused on professional treatment\054 comfort\054 wellness\054 and patient trust\056 For this project\054 I was responsible for creating the complete visual identity including logo design\054 branding assets\054 social media creatives\054 and digital promotional materials\056 The goal was to develop a clean and professional healthcare brand identity that reflects care\054 confidence\054 and modern medical excellence\056)
